<x-layout :information-unavailable="$informationUnavailable" title="Privacy notice"><section class="container page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Your information</span><h1>Privacy, clearly.</h1><p>Draft notice · pending venue approval before booking, messaging, and chatbot services open.</p></section><section class="container section prose"><h2>What this version does</h2><p>You can browse the public pages without creating an account. When online booking is enabled by the venue, you can submit a reservation request without an account. Tournament registration, messaging, and AI chat are not accepting information yet.</p><h2>Booking information</h2><p>Reservation requests collect your name, phone number, chosen table, schedule, and quoted price. Authorized staff use these details to review and manage your booking. Your private reference code allows status lookup; keep it confidential. Future registrations and contact messages will describe their data use before opening.</p><h2>Local browser storage</h2><p>Your theme preference is saved in your browser. The website also uses essential session and security cookies.</p><h2>AI disclosure</h2><p>The CueLab AI area is currently a placeholder. When connected, it will be identified as an AI assistant, use approved venue information, and offer a route to staff when it cannot help.</p><h2>Access, retention, and questions</h2><p>The venue’s privacy contact, retention period, hosting arrangements, and process for access or correction requests are pending confirmation. This notice must be completed before customer information is collected.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ route('contact') }}">View contact information ↗</a></section></x-layout>
